  "jp": "{px}……。",
  "en": "{px}..."
 },
 {
  "id": "dg11_04:000:11",
  "speaker": "白",
  "jp": "最後の{ruby:主|あるじ}が其方で、\n本当に……",
  "en": "That my last master was you... truly..."
 },
 {
  "id": "dg11_04:000:12",
  "speaker": "白",
  "jp": "―――よかった……。",
  "en": "--I am glad..."
 },
 {
  "id": "dg11_04:000:13",
  "speaker": "零",
  "jp": "{px}、きみと、\nきみの大切な\nひとたちの未来が、",
  "en": "{px}, may the future of you and the people dear to\nyou"
 },
 {
  "id": "dg11_04:000:14",
  "speaker": "零",
  "jp": "光と花に、\n満ち溢れていますように―――",
  "en": "overflow with light and flowers--"
 },
 {
  "id": "dg11_04:000:15",
